{"text": "The accused man stepped into the arena. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And faced two doors. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Exactly alike. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And side by side. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had to open one of them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And no one could help him choose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind one door was a hungry tiger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The fiercest that could be found. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If he opened that door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The tiger would leap upon him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At once as punishment for his guilt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind the other door was a lady. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The most suitable one. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king could find for him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If he opened this door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He would marry her right there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As a reward for his innocence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It did not matter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Whether he already had a wife. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Or loved someone else. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The people loved these trials. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because no one ever knew. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Which result was coming. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They might see. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A terrible death. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Or a happy wedding.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "a", "c", "c", "u", "s", "e", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "s", "t", "e", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", "n", "a", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "f", "a", "c", "e", "d", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "E", "x", "a", "c", "t", "l", "y", " ", "a", "l", "i", "k", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", 